    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hanging ornament, ear-ring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.69
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθινος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cord for suspension,</i> e. g. of the steelyard, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				853a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.834c13
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ αὑτοῦ ἄ. νεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.1.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>buoy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl.,
				<i>ligaments,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.125
			</span></i>.</div>
